Z||000007||LarryB||02-01-2001||10:22 AM||||Remember too that the language as spoken in France isn't quite the same as in Canada.  French Canadians speak it faster, the accent is somewhat different, and alot more English words and phrases have crept into the daily vernacular. <P>You'll also find many French Canadians that speak fluent English but lousy French.<P>||||reg||1
